<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#14110e">
<title>DhiRise · Student trial</title>
<link rel="icon" href="assets/dhirise-logo.png" type="image/png">
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="assets/interview%20bg/Q1.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&family=Mukta:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/question.css">
</head>
<body>
<main class="qscreen meet">

  <header class="brand">
    <img src="assets/dhirise-logo-light.png" alt="" width="56" height="56">
    <span>DhiRise</span>
  </header>

  <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="meetTitle">
    <p class="eyebrow">Founding batch · Student trial</p>
    <h1 id="meetTitle">Grow in marks. Grow in mind.</h1>
    <p class="intro">DhiRise is an institution and a student community. Our goal is students who do well in exams,
      handle pressure calmly, and live a healthy, mindful life.</p>

    <ul class="pillars">
      <li>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="2.5" width="12" height="19" rx="2.5"/><path d="M10 18.5h4M9 7h6M9 10.5h6M9 14h3"/></svg>
        <div><b>Productivity app</b>One place to learn, communicate, track your growth and present yourself.</div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.5"/><path d="M15.5 8.5l-2 5-5 2 2-5z"/></svg>
        <div><b>Mentorship</b>Guided by mentors and experienced alumni who have walked the same road.</div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="9.5" r="2.4"/><path d="M3.5 19c.6-3.2 2.8-5 5.5-5s4.9 1.8 5.5 5M14.5 14.2c.8-.5 1.6-.7 2.5-.7 2.2 0 3.7 1.4 4.2 4.5"/></svg>
        <div><b>Community</b>Students who grow together, as learners and as good human beings.</div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="meet-note">We're selecting students for our first trial batch. This short check helps us understand how you learn.</p>
    <p class="meet-meta">18 questions · about 5 minutes · no right or wrong answers.</p>
  </section>

</main>

<nav class="qnav">
  <button type="button" class="back" id="back">Back</button>
  <button type="button" class="next" id="start">Start the check</button>
</nav>

<script is:inline src="js/leaves.js"></script>
<script is:inline src="js/meet.js"></script>
<script is:inline src="js/music.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
